Root cause:
The bug was caused by an incorrect assumption about the number of key columns needed for the dependency cache, leading to an array size of 4 being used instead of the correct size of 3. This mismatch could result in accessing invalid memory or incorrect data during the hash table creation, potentially causing runtime errors or data corruption.

